@startuml
!theme plain
title Comparative Analysis of E-commerce Solutions

!define RECTANGLE class

package "Existing Solutions" {
    RECTANGLE "Shopify" {
        + SaaS Platform
        + Monthly Subscription
        + Limited Customization
        + Built-in Payment Gateway
        + App Ecosystem
        - High Long-term Costs
        - Vendor Lock-in
        - Limited ERP Integration
    }
    
    RECTANGLE "WooCommerce" {
        + Open Source
        + WordPress Integration
        + Extensive Plugins
        + Cost Effective
        + High Customization
        - Requires Technical Knowledge
        - Performance Issues
        - Security Maintenance
    }
    
    RECTANGLE "Magento" {
        + Enterprise Features
        + Multi-store Support
        + Advanced SEO
        + B2B Capabilities
        + Scalable Architecture
        - Complex Setup
        - High Resource Requirements
        - Expensive Licensing
    }
    
    RECTANGLE "PrestaShop" {
        + Free Open Source
        + Multi-language Support
        + Mobile Responsive
        + SEO Friendly
        + European Focus
        - Limited Scalability
        - Module Dependencies
        - Performance Limitations
    }
}

package "ZAI E-commerce Solution" {
    RECTANGLE "ZAI Platform" {
        + Custom Development
        + Dolibarr ERP Integration
        + Tailored Business Logic
        + Full Source Control
        + Cost-Effective Long-term
        + Specific Requirements Met
        + Direct Database Access
        + Custom Workflow Support
        - Initial Development Time
        - Requires Maintenance
    }
}

note right of "ZAI Platform" : **Key Differentiators:**\n• Native Dolibarr Integration\n• Custom Business Processes\n• Full Control & Ownership\n• Scalable Architecture\n• Cost-Effective Solution

note top of "Existing Solutions" : **Limitations for Our Use Case:**\n• Limited ERP Integration\n• High Ongoing Costs\n• Vendor Dependencies\n• Generic Solutions

@enduml